*   **total\_cost\_estimate\_5yr\_usd (0.00):** No specific data found for 5-year cost for this trim. Defaulted to average.
*   **insurance\_usd\_yr (0.00):** UK insurance group for the A250 is around 29E [23], which is around the national average. Defaulted to average.
*   **maint\_usd\_yr (0.00):** Mercedes maintenance can be higher than average [38], and the mild-hybrid system adds some complexity. Specific annual cost data for the A250 facelift was not readily available. Defaulted to average.
*   **repair\_risk\_score (0.00):** The A-Class generally has an average reputation for reliability, though some potential issues have been noted on earlier W177 models [9, 39, 40]. The facelift is relatively new, so long-term data is limited. Defaulted to average.
